{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01445",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 4.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "hello, doctor. I think it's my turn"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.51,
      "end_seconds": 10.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "so, that's fine, sit down tell me why you came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.97,
      "end_seconds": 17.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.23,
      "end_seconds": 22.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 25.83,
      "end_seconds": 32.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "It's burning when I pass urine, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.17,
      "end_seconds": 38.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "I follow. Is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.92,
      "end_seconds": 44.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "It, It happens a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.17,
      "end_seconds": 48.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.42,
      "end_seconds": 55.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "It usually comes with a dull ache low in my tummy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.94,
      "end_seconds": 59.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "have you been going to the toilet often?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.74,
      "end_seconds": 78.19,
      "duration_seconds": 15.45,
      "text": "um, yes, about the same, three days. The dull ache low in my tummy? That's been for about a week. As for dull ache low in my tummy, mostly mild"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.05,
      "end_seconds": 86.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.11,
      "text": "Have you had burning when you pass urine before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.78,
      "end_seconds": 91.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "A bit, last winter. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.24,
      "end_seconds": 96.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.26,
      "end_seconds": 109.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.14,
      "end_seconds": 138.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "okay: BP is 120 over 79, pulse 65, SpO2 99 percent on room air, temperature 36.8."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.45,
      "end_seconds": 142.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Actually, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.2,
      "end_seconds": 147.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "okay, I'll explain what these mean in a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.4,
      "end_seconds": 154.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.08,
      "end_seconds": 158.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.89,
      "end_seconds": 174.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "your tummy is soft with slight tenderness just above the pubic bone"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.44,
      "end_seconds": 186.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Have you had back pain, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.47,
      "end_seconds": 189.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "No. No back pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.3,
      "end_seconds": 195.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "did you get fever, blood in the urine or vaginal discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.81,
      "end_seconds": 200.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.86,
      "end_seconds": 203.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.55,
      "end_seconds": 207.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.97,
      "end_seconds": 211.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Okay, any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.56,
      "end_seconds": 214.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.59,
      "end_seconds": 218.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.62,
      "end_seconds": 233.34,
      "duration_seconds": 10.72,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I work in accounts at a hospital. I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.97,
      "end_seconds": 239.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.58,
      "end_seconds": 244.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "No, not that that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.12,
      "end_seconds": 249.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 250.46,
      "end_seconds": 256.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "he is on cranberry juice, daily, I give it to to him"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.42,
      "end_seconds": 261.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "how long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 263.29,
      "end_seconds": 264.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Six months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.28,
      "end_seconds": 273.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.93,
      "end_seconds": 277.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "my father has Parkinson's disease"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.05,
      "end_seconds": 296.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.62,
      "end_seconds": 303.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "just a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.18,
      "end_seconds": 326.53,
      "duration_seconds": 10.35,
      "text": "having listened and examined, this is probably an uncomplicated urinary infection that's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.05,
      "end_seconds": 378.73,
      "duration_seconds": 34.68,
      "text": "A urine dipstick is what I'd like next, for burning urine. What I'm giving you is nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day, three days. That's for urinary infection. Drink plenty of water and avoid holding urine. If you get a fever or back pain, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 380.72,
      "end_seconds": 387.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "So, I take the nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 389.04,
      "end_seconds": 394.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.23,
      "end_seconds": 397.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "alright, thanks, take care"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.61,
      "end_seconds": 400.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Alright, have a good day."
    }
  ]
}